@bank all
// TP1's words for the 0.99.7 playtest patch (plans/patch-0997.md notes 6, 7, 9, 11, 33, 53, 54; lead 49). Read only
// with TP997_ON (section 13's switch); with it off nothing reads these keys. Tips are one or two short sentences.

// note 6: Day 2, after Leila's evening at the call-home booths (19:00, or once your own call that day ends)
== tip.tp997.call
- One call home a day: the relay gives everyone aboard one call each ship day. The booths are yours again tomorrow.

// note 9: the Schedule tracker, early on Day 1 (the target button under your needs)
== tip.tp997.tracker
- The Schedule tracker, the target button under your needs, lists what's on now and next, and a few places. Tap one for an arrow; tap it again to stop.

// note 7: the tracker's Places row (title, then the line under it: {room} the washroom, {deck} its deck)
== tp997.loo.title
- Nearest bathroom
== tp997.loo.sub
- {room}, {deck}
== tp997.loo.none
- No public washroom you can reach

// note 54: the button at the top of Mail
== tp997.mail.all
- Mark all as read

// note 33: Pockets, the device app for what you carry ({item} the thing, {n} a number)
== tp997.pockets.title
- Pockets
== tp997.pockets.empty
- Your pockets are empty. Snacks and drinks from the crew store on Deck 3 wait here.
== tp997.pockets.food
- Snacks and drinks
== tp997.pockets.hands
- In your hands
== tp997.pockets.locker
- In your locker
== tp997.pockets.hobby
- Hobby supplies
== tp997.pockets.eat
- Eat
== tp997.pockets.drink
- Drink
== tp997.pockets.gift
- Tap a crewmate to give it.
== tp997.pockets.ate
- You eat {item}.
== tp997.pockets.drank
- You drink {item}.
== tp997.pockets.full
- Your pockets are full, so you have {item} on the way out.
== tp997.pockets.paid
- You pay {n} credits for {item}. It's in your Pockets, on your device, for later.
== tp997.pockets.busy
- Not now: finish what you're doing first.

// note 53: the tip once you're at a tradition, after its first sentence ("Tap Tomas to join the lap.")
== tp997.join.more
- Anyone already taking part can bring you in, too.

// note 53: the join words for the traditions that had none (tip: the arrow's label, {name} the leader's first name;
// notice: the toast when you join). Same shape as join.lines: what it is, what you do, what it gives.
== join997.first-light.tip
- Tap {name} to join First Light
== join997.first-light.notice
- First Light Cocoa: a cocoa at the big windows as the day begins. Leisure and social up.
== join997.tasting-table.tip
- Tap {name} to join the tasting
== join997.tasting-table.notice
- Brennan's tasting table: try two new dishes, pick your jar. Food, leisure and social up.
== join997.scone-morning.tip
- Tap {name} for a scone
== join997.scone-morning.notice
- Scone morning: a warm scone, and a joke to go with it. Food, leisure and social up.
== join997.five-minute-skills.tip
- Tap {name} to learn this week's skill
== join997.five-minute-skills.notice
- Five-minute skills: learn one small thing, then have a go. Leisure and social up.
== join997.coffee-trials.tip
- Tap {name} to taste the coffees
== join997.coffee-trials.notice
- The coffee machine trials: taste three cups blind, then vote. Leisure and social up.
== join997.jar-day.tip
- Tap {name} to fill a jar
== join997.jar-day.notice
- Jar day: fill a jar for the spice shelf and write its label. Leisure and social up.
== join997.beginners-guitar.tip
- Tap {name} to play a chord
== join997.beginners-guitar.notice
- Beginners' guitar: listen, then play your one chord. Leisure and social up.
== join997.midnight-toast.tip
- Tap {name} for toast
== join997.midnight-toast.notice
- Midnight toast: toast and tea with the night owls. Food, leisure and social up.
== join997.whodunnit-club.tip
- Tap {name} to join the whodunnit
== join997.whodunnit-club.notice
- Whodunnit club: hear the mystery, then write down your guess. Leisure and social up.
== join997.windowsill-herbs.tip
- Tap {name} to compare herbs
== join997.windowsill-herbs.notice
- Windowsill herbs: compare everyone's herbs and swap a cutting. Leisure and social up.
== join997.sounds-from-home.tip
- Tap {name} to listen
== join997.sounds-from-home.notice
- Sounds from home: sit back, lights low, and listen. Leisure and social up.
== join997.row-for-the-board.tip
- Tap {name} to row for the board
== join997.row-for-the-board.notice
- Row for the board: take a rower and race the clock with the others. Fitness and social up.
== join997.playlist-duel.tip
- Tap {name} to judge the duel
== join997.playlist-duel.notice
- Playlist duel: listen to both playlists, then pick a winner. Leisure and social up.
== join997.rec-lamplight-paddle.tip
- Tap {name} to paddle
== join997.rec-lamplight-paddle.notice
- Lamplight paddle: take a kayak and drift the slow channel. Leisure and social up.
== join997.rec-ring-the-bell.tip
- Tap {name} to climb for the bell
== join997.rec-ring-the-bell.notice
- Ring the bell: climb the wall and try for the bell at the top. Fitness and social up.
== join997.seed-packet-day.tip
- Tap {name} to fill a seed packet
== join997.seed-packet-day.notice
- Seed packet day: fold a packet, fill it and draw on it. Leisure and social up.
== join997.tool-night.tip
- Tap {name} to join tool night
== join997.tool-night.notice
- Tool night: shut your eyes and name each tool by touch. Leisure and social up.
== join997.route-night.tip
- Tap {name} to place your pin
== join997.route-night.notice
- Route night: pin where the Wren will be in seven days. Leisure and social up.
== join997.card-night.tip
- Tap {name} to make a card
== join997.card-night.notice
- Card night: make a card for a birthday coming up. Leisure and social up.
== join997.garden-walk.tip
- Tap {name} to walk the garden
== join997.garden-walk.notice
- Garden walk: walk the beds slowly with Cruz and taste one leaf. Leisure and social up.
== join997.window-sketch.tip
- Tap {name} to sketch
== join997.window-sketch.notice
- Window sketching: take a pencil and sketch the view. Leisure and social up.
== join997.window-sketch-2.tip
- Tap {name} to sketch
== join997.window-sketch-2.notice
- Window sketching: take a pencil and sketch the view. Leisure and social up.
== join997.open-house.tip
- Tap {name} to look round
== join997.open-house.notice
- Open house: a look round Comms and the Watch office. Leisure and social up.
== join997.spoon-band.tip
- Tap {name} to join the spoon band
== join997.spoon-band.notice
- The spoon band: grab anything that makes a noise and play along. Leisure and social up.
== join997.worst-joke.tip
- Tap {name} to tell a joke
== join997.worst-joke.notice
- Worst joke night: tell your worst joke, groan at the rest. Leisure and social up.
== join997.spice-shelf-supper.tip
- Tap {name} to join the supper
== join997.spice-shelf-supper.notice
- Spice shelf supper: sit down to supper and guess whose spice is whose. Food and social up.
== join997.off-the-tern.tip
- Tap {name} to welcome the new crew
== join997.off-the-tern.notice
- Off the Tern: stand at the foot of the ramp and welcome the new crew aboard. Social up.
== join997.new-hands-tea.tip
- Tap {name} for your tea
== join997.new-hands-tea.notice
- New hand's tea: your first Friday tea with the Works crew. Social up.
== join997.four-weeks-aboard.tip
- Tap {name} for a slice of cake
== join997.four-weeks-aboard.notice
- Four weeks aboard: a slice of the four-weeks cake with the Works crew. Social up.
== join997.six-weeks-aboard.tip
- Tap {name} to sit down for tea
== join997.six-weeks-aboard.notice
- Six weeks aboard: a tea with Zeke in the bow lounge. Social up.
== join997.twelve-weeks-aboard.tip
- Tap {name} to raise a cup
== join997.twelve-weeks-aboard.notice
- Twelve weeks aboard: sit down for Calder's toast in the mess. Social up.
== join997.open-door.tip
- Tap {name} for tea with the Chief
== join997.open-door.notice
- Open door: an end-of-shift tea with the Chief. Social up.

// RV32's find (lead 49): Day 1's arrow to the Chief's briefing (the arrow's label)
== tp997.d1.brief
- Morning briefing with the Chief, 08:50: the Works bay

// the same: Tuesday's arrows (the Chief's meeting, then the evening at the booths)
== tp997.d2.solo
- The Chief's office, 08:45: your first solo job
== tp997.d2.booths
- Calling home, the booths on Deck 3: Leila shows you how

// lead 49 (RV32's walk): every timed beat of the first week has an arrow (its label)
== tp997.beat.d3-store
- The crew store: Orla shows you round, till 17:30
== tp997.beat.d4-quiz
- 20:00 quiz night with Pell: the bow lounge
== tp997.beat.d5-mug
- 13:00 Friday tea with Halloran: the tea corner
== tp997.beat.d6-sowing
- 11:45 Sowing morning with Tomas: the garden

// after 0.99.7 (TP998_BOOTH_ON, R4's find): the low-social warnings once your call home's had today (no booth marker)
== tp998.social.1
- A bit lonely. You've had your call home today: chat with someone, or eat with company.
== tp998.social.2
- Really missing people. Your call home's done today: the mess and the bow lounge are rarely empty.
